#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:306
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_WantKingsRockStevenGaveMe"
msgid ""
"I got this from STEVEN, but I don't\n"
"know what it's good for.\p"
"I think it's called KING'S ROCK.\n"
"Do you want it?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:312
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_YouCanKeepIt"
msgid ""
"Why would you want it?\n"
"You're weird.\p"
"You can keep it, but keep it a secret\n"
"from STEVEN.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:318
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_StevensHouseOverThere"
msgid "STEVEN's house is right over there!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:321
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_WhatToDoWithWeirdRock"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you think so, too! What are you\n"
"supposed to do with some weird rock?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:325
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_WailmerWatching"
msgid ""
"Around MOSSDEEP, you can see wild\n"
"WAILMER.\p"
"It's called, uh…\n"
"What was it now…\p"
"WAI, WAI, WAI…\p"
"WAILMER watching!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:333
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_SpaceCenterReceivedLetter"
msgid ""
"The island's SPACE CENTER has been\n"
"launching huge rockets.\p"
"There's been some kind of an uproar\n"
"over a letter they received recently.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:339
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_SpaceCenterLaunchingRockets"
msgid ""
"The island's SPACE CENTER has been\n"
"launching huge rockets.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:343
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_MossdeepTargetedByMagma"
msgid ""
"I heard from a SAILOR buddy that\n"
"TEAM AQUA set up shop in LILYCOVE.\p"
"I also heard that someone came along\n"
"and wiped the floor with them!\p"
"But MOSSDEEP here's been targeted\n"
"by that TEAM MAGMA.\p"
"If you want to know what they're up to,\n"
"go visit the SPACE CENTER.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:353
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_FeelReliefOnLand"
msgid ""
"I'm a SAILOR, so the sea's obviously\n"
"more important to me.\p"
"But you know? When I get back on land\n"
"after a long voyage, I do feel relief!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:359
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_NiceIfWorldCoveredByFlowers"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't it be nice?\p"
"If the whole world was covered in\n"
"plants and flowers like this island?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:364
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_LifeNeedsSeaToLive"
msgid ""
"All life needs the sea to live, even\n"
"though it makes its home on the land.\p"
"Life, having run its course, becomes\n"
"soil and returns to the land.\p"
"And the sea is always connected to\n"
"the land.\p"
"Yes, like the very shoreline here.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:373
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_SurfExhilarating"
msgid ""
"A voyage on a ship is fine.\p"
"But crossing the sea with POKéMON\n"
"using SURF…\p"
"Now that's an exhilarating trip!\n"
"Wouldn't you agree, youngster?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:380
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_SpecialSpaceCenterRock"
msgid ""
"This rock has a special meaning to\n"
"the people at the SPACE CENTER.\p"
"They put it here as their wish for\n"
"their rockets to fly safely.\p"
"When you make a wish, what do you use?\n"
"Do you wish upon a star?\p"
"I use a wish tag to make it happen.\n"
"That's what I do.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:390
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_ItsAWhiteRock"
msgid "It's a white rock.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:393
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_GymSign"
msgid ""
"MOSSDEEP CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
"LEADERS: LIZA & TATE\p"
"“The mystic combination!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:398
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_CitySign"
msgid ""
"MOSSDEEP CITY\n"
"“Our slogan: Cherish POKéMON!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:402
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_SpaceCenterSign"
msgid ""
"MOSSDEEP SPACE CENTER\n"
"“The closest place to space.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:406
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_ScottSomethingWrongWithTown"
msgid ""
"SCOTT: {PLAYER}{KUN}, feeling good?\n"
"I'm doing great!\p"
"I'd heard MOSSDEEP's GYM LEADER is\n"
"pretty strong, so I decided to come\l"
"take a look-see for myself.\p"
"But there's something wrong about\n"
"this town.\p"
"People are going on about a warning\n"
"letter and the SPACE CENTER…\p"
"I don't think it concerns me in any\n"
"way, though.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity/scripts.inc:419
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_Text_SootopolisNewGymLeader"
msgid ""
"Ahh… It feels great letting the waves\n"
"wash over my feet…\p"
"Speaking of the waves, you know that\n"
"island city SOOTOPOLIS?\p"
"I think the GYM there had a new\n"
"LEADER come in.\p"
"People tell me the new LEADER once\n"
"mentored WALLACE.$"
msgstr ""
